<doctext field_name="doctext">No, you got the error saying that &lt;c&gt;$filename&lt;/c&gt;&lt;b&gt;.fa&lt;/b&gt; is uninitialized.
&lt;/p&gt;So perl saw that as a variable name while you intended to only use &lt;c&gt;$filename&lt;/c&gt; instead.
&lt;/p&gt;In order to delimit the variable name you can use this syntax: &lt;c&gt;"${filename}.fa"&lt;/c&gt;.
&lt;/p&gt;
Good luck, hexcoder</doctext>
